      "stage": "Establish and preserve the runnable thread",
      "work": "Enter one team's weekly availability through the supported intake, request a draft, inspect assigned and deliberately unfilled periods, select that draft and download it. Observe the actual participant path and compare downloaded assignments and unfilled periods with the selected table draft under D2. Preserve this path with focused deterministic regression.",
      "claim_limit": "A successful ordinary scenario establishes only its exercised relations and conditions. Direct state injection or separately calling components cannot establish the complete supported path."
    },
